{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33924","headline":"奉和鲁望寒夜访寂上人次韵 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望寒夜访寂上人次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"院寒青霭正沈沈，霜栈乾鸣入古林。\n数叶贝书松火暗，一声金磬桧烟深。\n陶潜见社无妨醉，殷浩谭经不废吟。\n何事欲攀尘外契，除君皆有利名心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33924.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33924","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}